WorldInfo {
  title "Meridian Time Chest"
  info [
    "Made By: BassMekanik"
    "Uploaded: August, 2026"
    "Store: Antique Shop"
    "Limited To: 1/30"
    "Mall Price: 40 CCs"
    "A colonial travelling chest of time reconciliation instruments."
    "Touch a brass drawer pull to slide that drawer open; touch the cream SHUT plate inside it to close it again."
    "Touch the MERIDIAN LIFT tile on the lid to raise the meridian arc; touch the medallion at the top of the arc to fold it down."
    "The three drawers and the arc are independent. Everything starts closed and folded."
  ]
}

